    "notes": "Helsingør is a small town at the narrowest point of the Sound, held as a vassal by the lord of Græsted-Gilleleje. Every ship between the Baltic and the North Sea must pass under our walls. A castle on the point and a toll on the water could make this little town the richest in the North.",
